### Bundled fonts — `public/fonts/`

| File | Typeface | Owner |
|---|---|---|
| `LINESeedKR-Rg.woff2` | LINE Seed KR | LINE Corporation |
| `NanumGothic.woff` | 나눔고딕 | NAVER |
| `GowunDodum-Regular.woff` | 고운돋움 | 고운글꼴 프로젝트 |
| `KyoboHandwriting2019.woff` | 교보손글씨 2019 | 교보문고 |
| `Cafe24Dongdong.woff` | 카페24 동동 | 카페24 |
| `TmoneyRoundWindRegular.woff` | 티머니 둥근바람 | 티머니 |
| `Recipekorea.woff` | 레시피코리아 | 레시피코리아 |

These are all free-to-use Korean typefaces, but **redistributing the font
files themselves** is a separate permission from using them, and the terms
differ per foundry. Check each licence before redistributing this repository's
`public/fonts/` directory.
